laser-bridges-and-doors:
This configurable mod introduces futuristic-looking laser bridges, doors, and fences, which are formed when a laser source block is activated by a redstone signal. 
 &nbsp; 

 Their length depends on the redstone signal strength and updates dynamically. 
 &nbsp; 

 You can color laser source blocks by clicking on them with a dye in hand or using a dispenser to apply the dye. 
 &nbsp; 


 Use full block laser sources to construct more complicated redstone contraptions. 
 &nbsp; 





 To craft a Laser Source Block, place a Glass Block and 7 Iron Ingots around an End Crystal in the crafting grid. You can craft a Laser Fence Source Block by placing a Laser Source Block in the crafting grid, and this conversion works both ways. 

 Configuration 
 You can configure this mod directly in-game or edit the JSON file config/laserbridges.json in your profile folder. 
